  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Extra_Disks/BH_ED_Header.png\" alt=\"页眉\" width=\"1903\" height=\"645\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Extra Disks 是 Refined Storage 的附加组件，提供了容量大得多的物品与流体磁盘。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Extra_Disks/BH_ED_Overview.png\" alt=\"概览\" width=\"1903\" height=\"150\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">每个对应的磁盘均可存储无限数量的物品和流体。这应该足够存放……水和圆石了吧？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MelanX/ExtraDisks/raw/1.18.x/images/creativetab.png\" alt=\"创造模式标签页\" width=\"850\" height=\"570\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Extra_Disks/BH_ED_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"广告\" width=\"1903\" height=\"347\"></a><span style=\"font-size:12px\">#广告 #推广</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
